OL,3,GNEWSAThe pathway promise: Why Scottish
OL,4,Afootball is struggling to produce young
OL,5,Atalent
OL,6,
OL,7,FCalum Ferguson achieved what thousands
OL,8,Fof young footballers dream of when he
OL,9,Fplayed for his boyhood club, Inverness
OL,10,FCaledonian Thistle, in the Scottish
OL,11,FPremiership.
OL,13,FYet the 31-year-old looks back on his
OL,14,Fcareer as proof of a difficult truth
OL,15,Fabout youth development in Scotland.
OL,17,FFerguson graduated from Caley Thistle's
OL,18,Facademy at 18 but played just two games
OL,19,Ffor the first team before moving to
OL,20,Flower league clubs and then to Canada
OL,21,Fand New Zealand to try to get
OL,22,Ftop-flight football.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
