OL,3,GNEWSAThe pathway promise: Why Scottish
OL,4,Afootball is struggling to produce young
OL,5,Atalent
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow a development officer with Alba
OL,8,FFootball Alliance, he believes Scottish
OL,9,Ffootball continues to sell young
OL,10,Fplayers and their families the promise
OL,11,Fof a pathway from the academies to the
OL,12,Ffirst team, which for most will never
OL,13,Fbe a reality.
